## Trust-model upgrade noted

Original design conditioned safety on caller intent (fleet-internal trust). Revised design is intent-INDEPENDENT — honest miscounts also can't violate the invariant. Safer for v2 scaling to less-trusted callers (per vigil HB#601 caveat).

